WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
A wheel nut is stuck fast.

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.270
You heave on a short spanner
with all your strength,

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.290
and nothing moves.

4
00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.010
Then you swap to a
much longer spanner.

5
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.110
You push just as hard
as before, no harder.

6
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.790
And the nut turns.

7
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.810
Same nut.

8
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.970
Same push.

9
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:20.910
So why does the longer spanner
work when the short one fails?

10
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.910
In this mission, you'll
meet the moment of a force,

11
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.690
its turning effect, and
learn to calculate it.

12
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.890
You'll use the principle of
moments to work out when something

13
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.410
will balance and when it will turn.

14
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.170
Your mission: explain why
the long spanner wins.
